<h3><u>Hussain Jaan</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="apple-style-span"><span  karbala</span></span><span 
<span class="apple-style-span">aye karbala khyal rakhio</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">teri aaghosh main sota hai hussain</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">ik zaeef maa ka</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">ik zaeef beta hai hussain</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">aur ik yateem beti ka</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">ik yateem baba hai hussain</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">mera mazloom</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">mera beqas</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">mera pyasa, (pyasa hai hussain *2)</span><br>
<br>
<span class="apple-style-span">haye awaaz ye aati hai sar-e-karbobla</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">jaisay karti ho koi maa koi beti girya</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">jis tarha koi bahan roy kahai wa waila</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">ya nabi katal hua aap ka pyara beta</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">hay hussain jaan (*6)</span><br>
<br>
<span class="apple-style-span">aai awaaz-e-nabi ye dosara maktal mai</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">meray bachay tujhai aai hai qaza jangle mai</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">aey mere noor-e-nazar</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">kushta-e-taigh-e-jafa hay hussain</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">hay hussain jaan (*6)</span><br>
<br>
<span class="apple-style-span">hath pahlu pe rakhai daiti thi zahra ye sada</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">chakia pees ke is maa ne tujhai pala tha</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">mairi godi mai hua</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">sar tera tan se juda hay hussain</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">hay hussain jaan (*6)</span><br>
<br>
<span class="apple-style-span">waqt-e-aakhir bhi tha zainab ke laboon par ye
sukhan</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">hay bhai tujhai jee bhar ke nai roee bahan</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">tishnagi baqi rahi aa gai mujh ko qaza hay hussain</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">hay hussain jaan (*6)</span><br>
<br>
<span class="apple-style-span">mere baba ki khata kya thi bta aey zaalim</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">koi chadar tan-e-be sar pe aurha de zaalim</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">soy gi beti kaha</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">thi sakeena ki sada hay hussain</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">hay hussain jaan (*6)</span><br>
<br>
<span class="apple-style-span">aik nanhi si lahad jo hai sar-e-dashat-e-bla</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">is mai jo sota hai us bachay ka zakhmi hai gla</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">apne baba ke liay</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">roh-e-asghar ne kaha hay hussain</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">hay hussain jaan (*6)</span><br>
<br>
<span class="apple-style-span">ashq-e-gham kehtay hai is baat mai sachai hai</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">baat rehan jo darwaish ne samjhai hai</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">dil bhi kahta hai mera</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">yeh hai tasbeeh-e-khuda hay hussain</span><br>
<span class="apple-style-span">hay hussain jaan (*6)</span></span></p></p>